 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. CV-STEP.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY SVSTATE.
 01 WS-I                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-NOW                 BINARY-DOUBLE.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY CONVH.
 COPY CLSTATE.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING CONVH.
     ADD 50 TO CV-NOW
     ADD 1 TO CV-STEPS-RUN
*>   The server loop: exactly one core tick per frame (the tick is due now), no waiting.
     IF CV-SERVER = 1
         CALL "CV-CD-SERVER" USING CONVH
         CALL "SV-NOW-MS" USING WS-NOW
         MOVE WS-NOW TO SV-NEXT-TICK
         CALL "SV-ITERATE"
         CALL "CV-CD-BACK"
     END-IF
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > CV-COUNT
         SET ADDRESS OF CLIENT-STATE TO CV-ADDR(WS-I)
         CALL "CL-STEP" USING CLIENT-STATE CV-EVENTS(WS-I) CV-EVENT-COUNT(WS-I) CV-NOW
         MOVE 0 TO CV-EVENT-COUNT(WS-I)
     END-PERFORM
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM CV-STEP.

