 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. CV-TEXTS.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-I                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-PTR                 BINARY-LONG.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY CONVH.
 COPY CLSTATE.
 01 L-INDEX                BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-TEXT                 PIC X(1024).
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING CONVH L-INDEX L-TEXT.
     SET ADDRESS OF CLIENT-STATE TO CV-ADDR(L-INDEX)
     MOVE SPACES TO L-TEXT
     MOVE 1 TO WS-PTR
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > SM-WIDGET-COUNT
         IF WS-I > 1
             STRING "|" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO L-TEXT WITH POINTER WS-PTR
         END-IF
         IF SM-W-LENGTH(WS-I) > 0
             STRING SM-W-TEXT(WS-I)(1:SM-W-LENGTH(WS-I)) DELIMITED BY SIZE
                 INTO L-TEXT WITH POINTER WS-PTR
         END-IF
     END-PERFORM
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM CV-TEXTS.

